PAGE_VSPACE (4.0)
ROW_ALIGN_MIDDLE
ROW_START_FS (HN 8 0.25 4.0)
STAMP_ADD_IMG (35.0 26.0 "../spacing-v1/images/san-marino.jpg" "" "" "San Marino (Page 1: Default)")
